<title>ARGENTINA: Bulgaria buys 300,000 tonnes Argentine wheat - trade.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria buys 300,000 tonnes Argentine wheat - trade.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine traders confirmed Friday that Bulgaria bought Thursday night 300,000 tonnes Argentine wheat for between $133 and $135 FOB for January/March shipments.</p>
<p>&quot;The sellers were most probably a pool,&quot; a trader said, adding, &quot;Argentine wheat is very competitive at this moment in a world market with a strong demand.&quot;</p>
<p>Another trader said freight rates from Argentina to Bulgaria would amount to about $30 a tonne.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
<p>--Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
